1
00:00:00,750 --> 00:00:07,490
So, Adjika Owens was laid to rest in Florida yesterday.

2
00:00:08,450 --> 00:00:16,370
Adjika Owens is the mother of four who was brutally shot through the door by her neighbor

3
00:00:16,370 --> 00:00:22,170
after she came to confront the neighbor for assaulting her children physically and verbally.

4
00:00:23,290 --> 00:00:25,890
The neighbor cited the Stand Your Ground law.

5
00:00:26,630 --> 00:00:29,770
On its surface, the Stand Your Ground law is simply self-defense.

6
00:00:29,770 --> 00:00:35,390
In a state like Florida, where we know that racism drives the governance,

7
00:00:35,770 --> 00:00:40,130
we know that the Stand Your Ground law, which was also used in George Zimmerman's case,

8
00:00:40,270 --> 00:00:41,930
where he murdered Trayvon Martin,

9
00:00:42,290 --> 00:00:51,070
is simply a cover for being able to take the lives of black people without having to be charged for it.

10
00:00:51,250 --> 00:00:55,150
Because if someone's skin color is what makes them a weapon,

11
00:00:55,150 --> 00:01:03,330
then just showing up as your black self is justification for someone to take a fatal effort

12
00:01:03,330 --> 00:01:05,810
at defending themselves against your existence.

13
00:01:06,450 --> 00:01:08,010
May Ms. Owens rest in peace.

14
00:01:08,690 --> 00:01:12,150
And may we all continue to fight for the repeal of these types of laws

15
00:01:12,150 --> 00:01:16,970
so that black people everywhere can live in peace.

